>Your 20Mhz makes more difference!  I did this with my 6MHz '286,
>following the docs.  Made practically no difference.  I have something
>like 612Mb free (DOS 5.0, actually, rather than 6.0, and MS rather than
>DR - but unless DR is doing some sort of magic on DOS calls to make
>protected-mode switching hyperfast, I don't see what difference this
